  "grammar": [
    {
      "id": "u04_l1_g1",
      "pattern": "못 V",
      "meaning_uz": "Qila olmaslik: '...-a olmayman'",
      "meaning_en": "Can't: not being able to do something",
      "explanation_md": "**못** fe'ldan oldin kelib, **qobiliyat yoki imkoniyat yo'qligini** bildiradi: o'zbekchadagi **\"-a olmayman\"**.\n\n**저는 수영을 못 해요.** — *Men suza olmayman.*\n\n### 안 va 못 farqi\n\n| | Ma'nosi | Misol |\n|---|---|---|\n| **안** | qilmayman (xohlamayman, tanlovim) | 고기를 **안** 먹어요 — go'sht yemayman |\n| **못** | qila olmayman (qo'limdan kelmaydi, imkon yo'q) | 매운 음식을 **못** 먹어요 — achchiq taom yeya olmayman |\n\n### Qanday ishlatiladi\n\n- Oddiy fe'l: **못 + fe'l**: 못 가요, 못 먹어요, 못 쳐요\n- **N하다** fe'llari: **N + 못 하다** — 못 **o'rtaga** kiradi: 수영하다 → **수영 못 해요** (~~못 수영해요~~ emas), 운동하다 → **운동 못 해요**\n- O'tgan zamon: 어제 **못 갔어요** — kecha bora olmadim\n\n### Esda tuting\n\n- **못** faqat **fe'l** bilan ishlatiladi. Sifat bilan — **안**: 날씨가 **안** 좋아요 (~~못 좋아요~~ emas).\n- **잘 못** — \"yaxshi qila olmayman\": 테니스를 **잘 못** 쳐요.\n- Talaffuz: **못 해요** → [모태요].",
      "explanation_md_en": "**못** comes before a verb and shows that you **can't** do something (no ability or no chance): English **\"can't\"**.\n\n**저는 수영을 못 해요.** — *I can't swim.*\n\n### 안 vs 못\n\n| | Meaning | Example |\n|---|---|---|\n| **안** | I don't (my choice, I don't want to) | 고기를 **안** 먹어요 — I don't eat meat |\n| **못** | I can't (I'm not able, there's no way) | 매운 음식을 **못** 먹어요 — I can't eat spicy food |\n\n### How to use it\n\n- Ordinary verb: **못 + verb**: 못 가요, 못 먹어요, 못 쳐요\n- **N하다** verbs: **N + 못 하다** — 못 goes **in the middle**: 수영하다 → **수영 못 해요** (not ~~못 수영해요~~), 운동하다 → **운동 못 해요**\n- Past: 어제 **못 갔어요** — I couldn't go yesterday\n\n### Remember\n\n- **못** is used only with **verbs**. With adjectives use **안**: 날씨가 **안** 좋아요 (not ~~못 좋아요~~).\n- **잘 못** — \"can't do it well\": 테니스를 **잘 못** 쳐요.\n- Pronunciation: **못 해요** → [모태요].",
      "formation": [
        {
          "condition_uz": "Oddiy fe'l",
          "condition_en": "Ordinary verb",
          "rule": "못 + V",
          "example": "가다 → 못 가요, 치다 → 못 쳐요"
        },
        {
          "condition_uz": "N하다 fe'li",
          "condition_en": "N하다 verb",
          "rule": "N + 못 하다",
          "example": "수영하다 → 수영 못 해요"
        },
        {
          "condition_uz": "O'tgan zamon",
          "condition_en": "Past tense",
          "rule": "못 + V-았/었어요",
          "example": "못 갔어요"
        }
      ],
      "examples": [
