        }
      ],
      "uz_compare": "-고 싶다 o'zbekchadagi '-moqchiman' yoki '-gim keladi' ga to'g'ri keladi: 배우고 싶어요 = o'rganmoqchiman / o'rgangim keladi. 'U ... -moqchi' deganda esa koreyschada -고 싶어해요.",
      "compare_en": "-고 싶다 matches English 'want to': 배우고 싶어요 = I want to learn. But English uses the same 'wants to' for everyone, while Korean switches to -고 싶어해요 for he/she: 동생은 축구를 하고 싶어해요."
